Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:24.70,Title,0,0,0,0,,《007系列之女王密使》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.89,0:00:53.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（环球出口有限公司 伦敦）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.96,0:00:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我多年来一直都说 我们的特别仪器过时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've said for years that our special equipment is obsolete.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:01:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在借着电脑分析显示 仪器有微型化的趋势\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, computer analysis reveals a new approach: miniaturization.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.34,0:01:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如说 放射性线头\N{\fnArial\fs30}For instance, radioactive lint.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.07,0:01:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,放进敌人的口袋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}When placed in an opponent's pockets…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.41,0:01:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以找到对方的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the personnel and location fix seems obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.61,0:01:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找的是007的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we want is a location fix on 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.82,0:01:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,十号情报员为了“疯人院行动” 大发牢骚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number 10 is making ugly noises about Operation Bedlam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.29,0:01:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱班霓 跟通讯部门联络了没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Moneypenny, did you check with Communications?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.92,0:01:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,开罗 阿姆斯特丹和穆德里 都没有他的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Replies to our Cairo, Amsterdam and Madrid inquiries: all negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.93,0:01:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,若找到007 首相希望我们私下通知他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The PM wants to be informed personally when we find 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.31,0:04:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫邦德 詹姆斯邦德 你是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning. My name's Bond. James Bond. Miss…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.82,0:04:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.06,0:04:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.29,0:04:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,把双手放在脑后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your hands behind your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.13,0:04:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.84,0:05:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.81,0:05:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,躺下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.39,0:06:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人就不会遇上这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This never happened to the other fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.69,0:09:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有行李吗？- 在行李箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Baggage, sir? - In the boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.46,0:09:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心那些球杆 - 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take care of those clubs. - Right, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.93,0:09:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 邦德长官 你好吗？- 曼努尔 好高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Commander Bond. How are you? - Good to see you, Manuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.77,0:09:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来保持着一贯的高水平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything seems up to the Palacio's usual standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.47,0:09:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 这个季节的生意不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it's a good season.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.47,0:10:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那红色车子的主人 是一位女士吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That red car, does it belong to a lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.97,0:10:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是泰丽莎文西佐伯爵夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Contessa Teresa di Vincenzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.48,0:10:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最上等的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.15,0:10:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好客人临时取消订房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortunately, we have had a cancellation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.12,0:10:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.13,0:10:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 这就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will do. This will do me nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.67,0:10:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定能照顾你特别的需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure we can look after your special needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.34,0:10:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you can. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.14,0:10:36.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（赌场）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.56,0:11:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.36,0:11:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,两万法郎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty thousand francs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.03,0:12:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too rich for my blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.90,0:12:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madame?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.57,0:12:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.47,0:12:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 但是我没钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I regret too, but I don't have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.47,0:12:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她付不出钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dame can't pay up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.31,0:12:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我没有集中精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me. My mind was elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.65,0:12:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她忘了今晚我们是拍档\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madame has forgotten we agreed to be partners this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.28,0:12:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,请继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,真幸运 最后关头有人解围\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's lucky, being bailed out like that at the last minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.63,0:13:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,服务生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.30,0:13:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一九五七年的当培利洋香槟 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dom Perignon, '57. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.88,0:13:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛老是要救我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you persist in rescuing me, Mr. Bond?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.14,0:13:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这成为我的习惯 泰丽莎伯爵夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's becoming a habit, Contessa Teresa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.05,0:13:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰丽莎是个圣人 叫我崔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teresa was a saint. I'm known as Tracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.32,0:13:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔西 下次不要冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tracy, next time play it safe and stand on five.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.45,0:13:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想死的人才不敢冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}People who want to stay alive play it safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.89,0:13:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,请好好的活着 至少今晚不要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please stay alive, at least for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.77,0:13:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会儿上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.90,0:13:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望真的值得吧拍档\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope it'll be worth it, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.14,0:13:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,送到423号套房 加两份鱼子酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send it to suite 423 with caviar for two.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.44,0:14:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tracy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.91,0:14:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tracy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.73,0:15:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲锋客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gatecrasher.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.23,0:15:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来清理这儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll leave you to tidy up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.41,0:15:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是皇室白鲟 来自里海北部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Royal beluga, north of the Caspian.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.36,0:16:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伯爵夫人 你总是叫人意外 - 你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're full of surprises, contessa. - So are you, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.30,0:16:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你约会时都带着手枪的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you always have a gun for a rendezvous?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.80,0:16:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候吧 我是个易出事的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Occasionally. I seem to be accident-prone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.07,0:16:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不介意的话 把枪给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take that, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.98,0:16:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你挺有自信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're very confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.38,0:16:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我为了好玩而杀了你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suppose I kill you for a thrill?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.21,0:16:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,有其他方法可以增进彼此了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can think of something more sociable to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.75,0:16:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再玩了 你房里的男人是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop playing games. Who was that man in your room?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.12,0:16:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你弄得我好痛 - 我以为这是今晚的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're hurting me. - I thought that was the idea tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.02,0:16:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说 他是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, who was he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.23,0:17:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.99,0:17:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以更有说服力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can be a lot more persuasive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.86,0:17:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.77,0:17:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我是谁 我不是骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever else I may be, I'm not a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.01,0:17:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿上衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.40,0:17:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个很特别的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the most extraordinary girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.80,0:17:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你的评语没兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not interested in your opinion of me, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.81,0:17:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来这儿为了做生意 - 真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm here for a business transaction. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.58,0:17:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝这种牌子太浓了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't Le Bleu a bit heady for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.48,0:18:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了香水以外 你还懂得什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know your perfumes. What else do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.25,0:18:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解一点女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little about women.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.49,0:18:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about me…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.66,0:18:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚买回来的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as a woman you've just bought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.43,0:18:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么需要买女人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who needs to buy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.13,0:18:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没欠我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you don't owe me a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.61,0:18:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你好像有麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.61,0:18:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,想跟我谈一谈吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to talk about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.78,0:18:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.78,0:18:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需要知道 我会还欠你的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing you need know about me is that I pay my debts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.28,0:18:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,两万法郎不是小数目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty thousand francs is a lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.16,0:19:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早 邦德长官 - 咖啡室订座 两位\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning, Commander Bond. - Good morning. Cafe complet for two.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.66,0:19:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 长官 - 替我接423房\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir. - Connect me with suite 423, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.63,0:19:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,文西佐伯爵夫人已经退房了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Contessa di Vincenzo has left the hotel, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.43,0:19:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 退房了？- 几分钟以前退的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Checked out? - A few minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.90,0:19:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.55,0:19:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,全数归还\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paid in full, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.10,0:19:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 邦德先生？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Bond? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.90,0:19:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你掉了一些东西 - 真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've lost something. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.27,0:19:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到外面还给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll give it to you outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.61,0:20:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何不可？凑够四个人打牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not? Perhaps we can make up a foursome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.38,0:20:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想的真周到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've thought of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.45,0:20:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好一个惊喜 那么快又见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a lovely surprise, our meeting again so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.89,0:20:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次到哪里玩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the party this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.83,0:20:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有个约会 - 谈生意还是寻开心？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have an appointment. - Business or pleasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.83,0:20:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,神秘之旅吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mystery tour, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.34,0:20:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你不拿着它 气氛会轻松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we'd enjoy it more without that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.18,0:21:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要杀我 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not kill me, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.65,0:21:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码先让我们喝点酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least not until we've had a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.85,0:21:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你还是要杀我 我再给你机会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then if you wish, I'll give you another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.05,0:21:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是跩哥 跩哥建筑公司的老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Draco, of Draco Construction.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.83,0:22:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今天是十三号 先生 - 我很迷信\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But today is the 13th, commander. - I'm superstitious.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.04,0:22:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给客人一杯马丁尼 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A martini for our guest. - A pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.51,0:22:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,要摇的 不要搅的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shaken, not stirred.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.74,0:22:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 给我一杯堪培利酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course. - Campari for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.75,0:22:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,很对不起用这种方式把你带来 请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}My apologies for the way you were brought here today. Please sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.75,0:22:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不肯定你会否接受正式的邀请\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was not sure you would accept a formal invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.02,0:22:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,要动用手枪 一定是正式的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's always something formal about the point of a pistol.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.86,0:22:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, cheri.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.69,0:22:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们待会儿再继续挣扎吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Olympe, we will finish our struggle later.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.13,0:22:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.36,0:22:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她下西洋棋很棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she also plays a very good game of chess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.87,0:22:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.87,0:22:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你常常喝科西嘉白兰地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You usually drink Corsican brandy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.87,0:22:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还知道我什么事情？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else do you know about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.71,0:22:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,马克安跩哥 科西嘉联盟首脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marc Ange Draco: Head of the Union Corse.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.14,0:22:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是欧洲庞大的犯罪集团\N{\fnArial\fs30}A big crime syndicate in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.55,0:22:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 最大的犯罪集团 - 也不算\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The biggest. - Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.22,0:22:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个叫幽灵的国际性集团\N{\fnArial\fs30}An organization known as SPECTRE operates worldwide.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.59,0:23:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你的合法生意比较广泛\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your legitimate business fronts are more extensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.39,0:23:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,建筑 电子产品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Construction, electrical supplies…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.89,0:23:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有无数的农业公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}…numerous agricuItural holdings.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.76,0:23:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手上关于我的档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dossier on me…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.60,0:23:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不够完整\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is not entirely complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.63,0:23:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是泰丽莎的爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am also Teresa's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.77,0:23:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 崔西 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tracy. - Yes, Tracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.14,0:23:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我唯一的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tracy. My only child.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.88,0:23:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的母亲是英国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her mother was an English girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.81,0:23:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很浪漫 她到科西嘉寻找强盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A romantic who had come to Corsica to look for bandits.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.45,0:23:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像那些到沙漠 寻找酋长的女人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rather like those women who ventured into the desert looking for sheiks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.29,0:23:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在山上找到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She found me in the mountains…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.83,0:23:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我正在逃避警方追捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}…hiding from the police at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.29,0:23:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来我就爱上她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to love this girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.26,0:23:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们结婚了 结果生下了泰丽莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}We married. The resuIt: Teresa.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.67,0:23:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,十二年后 我太太死了 我送泰丽莎到瑞士去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twelve years later, my wife died. I sent Teresa to Switzerland…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.67,0:23:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 谢谢 我喜欢自己的 - 送她去完成学业\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, thanks, I prefer my own. - …to finish her education.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.94,0:23:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜我没有给她一个温暖的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, I didn't give her a proper home.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.28,0:24:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人看管她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was without supervision.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.28,0:24:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以她跟一伙坏人混上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So she joined a fast international set.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.52,0:24:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞出一桩又一桩丑事\N{\fnArial\fs30}One scandal after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.02,0:24:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不满意的时候 就不给她生活费\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I disapproved, cut off her allowance…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.96,0:24:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就更放纵\N{\fnArial\fs30}…she committed some greater folly…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.33,0:24:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,故意要令我烦恼\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to spite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.06,0:24:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而 在她虚张声势的外表下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, behind her bravado…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.23,0:24:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,内心却十分空虚\N{\fnArial\fs30}…something was eating away at her soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.20,0:24:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这情况都可能发生在 所有人的身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can happen to men and women.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.31,0:24:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们太贪婪 伤害自己的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}They burn the heart out of themselves by living too greedily…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.84,0:24:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and suddenly…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.31,0:24:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一切都完了 - 干嘛告诉我这些？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …all is finished. - Why tell me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.75,0:24:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她嫁给\N{\fnArial\fs30}She married…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.25,0:24:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个意大利伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}…an Italian count who killed himself…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.75,0:24:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙跟他其中一个情妇 死在一辆法拉利内\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in a Maserati with one of his mistresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.82,0:24:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给她的太多 结果却一无所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave her too much, and it brought her nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.89,0:24:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我干嘛告诉你这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, why I tell you all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.27,0:24:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你为我的女儿所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been informed of everything you've done for my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.17,0:25:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一切？- 别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everything? - Don't worry. Don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.17,0:25:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所做的 你的表现\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you did, the way you behaved…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.68,0:25:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是对她的治疗的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}…might be the beginning of some kind of therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.11,0:25:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}She needs help.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.98,0:25:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.05,0:25:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得她不错 但她需要的是 精神病医生 不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find her fascinating, but she needs a psychiatrist, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.62,0:25:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她需要一个能支配她的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What she needs is a man to dominate her…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.19,0:25:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟她上床 直到让她爱上他\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to make love to her enough to make her love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.36,0:25:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你正是合适人选\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.17,0:25:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你高估我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You overestimate me, Draco.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.30,0:25:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很吸引 但你要找的人不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's very attractive, but what you ask is not for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.44,0:25:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你跟她结婚那天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. On the day you marry her…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.51,0:25:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会私下给你嫁妆 是价值一百万磅的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'll give you a personal dowry of one million pounds…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.72,0:25:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄金\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.42,0:25:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,条件很吸引人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's quite an inducement.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.42,0:25:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不需要一百万磅黄金\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't need a million pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.83,0:25:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我喜欢自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have a taste for freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.66,0:26:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你多跟她在一起 谁知道结果会怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, just see her some more. Who knows what will come of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.67,0:26:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 碍于我的工作 我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Draco, but in my profession, I can't…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.90,0:26:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 你还有事情隐瞒我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - You have connections not open to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.61,0:26:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧士斯达洛布费德在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Ernst Stavro Blofeld?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.08,0:26:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,布费德？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blofeld?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.91,0:26:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的几个部下跟他走了 我不知道他在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of my men defected to him. I don't know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.48,0:26:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能够找到他吗？- 即使我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you find out? - If I could…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.92,0:26:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不会告诉特工处\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I wouldn't tell Her Majesty's Secret Service…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.26,0:26:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只会告诉我未来的女婿\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I might tell my future son-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.13,0:26:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.60,0:26:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,下星期是我的生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next week is my birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.43,0:26:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰丽莎通常会回来贺寿\N{\fnArial\fs30}For that, Teresa always comes back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.94,0:26:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.31,0:26:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会考虑你的建议 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's say I'll sleep on the idea. - You do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.95,0:26:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 你去了哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.15,0:26:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 离你很远的地方 甜心 - 还是老样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Much too far from you, darling. - Same old James.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.46,0:26:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且变本加厉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only more so.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.52,0:27:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没心肝的好色鬼 让我消瘦 连明信片也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heartless brute, letting me pine away without even a postcard.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.49,0:27:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用再消瘦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pine no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.03,0:27:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,到我家喝鸡尾酒吧 八点钟 只我们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cocktails at my place, 8-ish, just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.90,0:27:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你的邀请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'd adore that…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.30,0:27:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我可不相信自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if only I could trust myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.14,0:27:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是老样子 活像英国的最后防线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same old Moneypenny: Britain's last line of defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.81,0:27:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好快点进去 他今天很忙碌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd better go in. He's running a very tight ship today.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.77,0:27:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要终止你的疯人院行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm relieving you from Operation Bedlam, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.84,0:27:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我必须对付布费德\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, sir, Blofeld's something of a must with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.54,0:27:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找他找了两年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've had two years to run him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.67,0:27:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我失去信心了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've lost confidence in me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.68,0:27:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很清楚你的才干\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm well aware of your talents, 007…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.18,0:27:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但杀人通行证也要找到他才管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but license to kill is useless unless one has a target.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.58,0:27:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会给你另一个更合适的任务 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll find you a more suitable assignment. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.45,0:28:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官 - 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir… - That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.06,0:28:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,会议那么快就结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a quick conference.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.93,0:28:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么要一个女孩保持吸引力\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you expect a girl to keep herself alluring?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.90,0:28:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我写一张备忘录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a memo, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.87,0:28:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了 - 我郑重请求\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ready, James. - Sir, I have the honor to request…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.11,0:28:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你接受我的辞职 即时生效\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you will accept my resignation, effective forthwith.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.95,0:28:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 辞什么职？- 辞退英国特工处的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Resignation from what? - Her Majesty's Secret Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.32,0:28:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,请把它呈给里面的老顽固\N{\fnArial\fs30}And kindly present it to that monument in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.87,0:29:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.81,0:29:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}007… James Bond here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.37,0:29:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants you, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.69,0:29:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求获准了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Request granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.14,0:29:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求获准了 连挽留都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Request granted. Not even with regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.97,0:30:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么了 想当爵士吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you expect, a knighthood?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.34,0:30:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛不看看它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you read it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.38,0:30:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,两星期假期\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Two weeks leave."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.15,0:30:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是真的想辞职吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't really want to resign, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.15,0:30:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱班霓 没有你我怎么办呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moneypenny, what would I do without you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.49,0:30:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是你从来没有 跟我干过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}My problem is that you never do anything with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.49,0:30:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我回来的时候 我跟你约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a date. The moment I get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.66,0:30:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要去哪里？- 找个地方混日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you off to? - Just someplace to laze about.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.70,0:30:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,去海边流浪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beachcombing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.17,0:30:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱班霓 没有你我怎么办？谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would I do without you, Miss Moneypenny? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.93,0:30:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早 米格尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bonjour, Miguel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.72,0:31:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 泰丽莎 你好 - 你早\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Teresa, hello. - Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.49,0:31:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好久不见了 - 你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's so nice that we see you. - How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.56,0:31:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 非常好 - 崔西来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, very well. - There's Tracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.07,0:31:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪里？在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she? Ah, there she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.47,0:31:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 泰丽莎 - 爸爸生日快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Teresa! - Happy birthday, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.37,0:31:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来了我的生日就快乐 你好漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make it so by being here. You look marvelous.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.67,0:31:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你介绍一个人 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's someone I want you to meet. Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.88,0:31:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奥莉 你好吗？- 你回来了真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Olympe, how are you? - It's good to have you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.88,0:31:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好漂亮 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You look wonderful. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.12,0:31:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 这是我的女儿泰丽莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bond, may I introduce my daughter, Teresa?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.92,0:32:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伯爵夫人 - 我们见过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Contessa. - Mr. Bond and I have already met.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.76,0:32:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一次见面都更快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each time is a renewed pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.16,0:32:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐总让人觉得愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madame always makes one feel so welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.60,0:32:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她喜欢你 我看得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She likes you. I can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.64,0:32:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,介绍你的眼科医生给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must give me the name of your oculist.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.41,0:32:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥莉 我不知道 邦德先生认识爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Olympe, I didn't know Mr. Bond knew Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.45,0:32:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生总是让人摸不着头脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is much about Mr. Bond one does not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.22,0:32:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许上夜间部课程会很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be interesting to attend night school, perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.86,0:32:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸一定在搞些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Papa is up to something. I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.23,0:32:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很爱你的 崔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father loves you very much, Tracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.70,0:32:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论他安排了什么 他只想你高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever he may arrange, I know it's for your happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.67,0:32:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他安排了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What has Papa arranged?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.49,0:33:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 邦德先生 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ah, Mr. Bond! - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.16,0:33:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 祝你越来越快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Many happy returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.66,0:33:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿以后越来越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best years are still to come, let's hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.57,0:33:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.07,0:33:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.67,0:33:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你爸请我来的 很棒吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, wasn't it kind of your father to invite me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.51,0:33:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在谈生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're discussing a business deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.51,0:33:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.78,0:33:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人不会浪费了这好酒 来谈生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}No woman would waste this excellent champagne discussing business.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.48,0:33:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非是受到别人的安排吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless she happened to be part of the arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.15,0:33:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对她说了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.52,0:33:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别骂奥莉了 我最了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't blame Olympe. I'm not your daughter for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.22,0:33:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真的很像一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I detect a certain family resemblance.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.59,0:33:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你 重新考虑你们合约的条款\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest you revise the terms of your contract, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.93,0:33:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的责任太昂贵了 - 你误会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your liability is too expensive. - There you're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.80,0:33:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Papa. - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.07,0:33:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 邦德先生想要一些情报 - 你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Bond wants some information. - What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.37,0:33:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你教我做一个好主人 要给他客人所需的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You taught me that a good host supplies his guests' needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.87,0:33:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且不需他负责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}And without obligation.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.51,0:34:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那又如何？- 你说负责任不太对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And then? - "Obligation" is not the right word.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.71,0:34:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他吧 告诉他希望知道的情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him, Papa. Tell him what he wants to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.62,0:34:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在就说 - 别这样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now! - Please, Teresa.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.79,0:34:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一个可能 事情没有绝对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only a possibility. Nothing definite.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.12,0:34:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他 否则你以后不会再见到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him, Papa, or you'll never see me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.40,0:34:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.34,0:34:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.07,0:34:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个布费德也许跟\N{\fnArial\fs30}There may be a connection between that man Blofeld…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.47,0:34:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在瑞士伯尔尼一家公司 的律师有关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and a lawyer with offices in Bern, Switzerland.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.11,0:34:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他叫格布德 - 格布德\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Named Gumbold. - Gumbold.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.05,0:34:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瑞士伯尼尔 - 对 格布德\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bern, Switzerland. - Yes, Gumbold.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.79,0:34:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.42,0:34:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 邦德先生不用对我有兴趣 - 你又误会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Bond need have no interest in me. - Another mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.09,0:34:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她总是那么顽固\N{\fnArial\fs30}She always was a headstrong child.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.69,0:34:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.96,0:34:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去哪里了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where has he gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.97,0:35:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tracy!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.15,0:35:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.65,0:35:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总觉得要解释误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was always taught that mistakes should be remedied.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.49,0:35:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是朋友之间的误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially between friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.59,0:35:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者情人之间的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or lovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.15,0:37:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我待会儿去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll catch up with you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.25,0:37:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一如以往？- 记得冰镇我的马丁尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The story of our life, James? - Just keep my martini cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.03,0:37:39.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（戈布达格布德办事处）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.66,0:38:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一小时内回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be back in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.33,0:40:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些事情该留给爸爸办 我知道什么对你最好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such things should be left to a girl's father, who knows best.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.77,0:40:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么事情比谈恋爱更好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what could be better than being in love?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.91,0:40:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生爱上了你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bond is in love with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.91,0:40:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,终有一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}That may come too…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.51,0:40:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会爱上我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.68,0:40:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有生之年可能等不到这一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life's too short for "someday", Teresa.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.95,0:40:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天我会跟他单独谈一谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow I will speak to him alone, man-to-man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.12,0:40:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不要谈 - 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, Papa. No talk. - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.96,0:40:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何我也不后悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever happens, there'll be no regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.80,0:40:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.66,0:44:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 午安 - 午安 海军上将在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good afternoon. - Good afternoon. Is the admiral in?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.71,0:44:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 邦德长官想见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, sir. Commander Bond to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.04,0:44:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,请他进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.54,0:44:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请你进来 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aye, aye, sir. If you please. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.22,0:44:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,它比一般的绿蛱蝶小\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unusually small for a Nymphalis polychloros.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.99,0:44:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道原来 你对鳞翅目昆虫也有研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't aware that your expertise included lepidoptery.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.73,0:44:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你来干嘛？你在放假 - 宗谱学\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why are you here? You're on leave. - Genealogy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.90,0:44:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fascinating subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.74,0:45:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在瑞士 戈布达格布德律师那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found a letter from Gebruder Gumbold, solicitors in Switzerland…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.54,0:45:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到给巴达哈博堪普伯爵的信\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to a certain Count BaIthazar de Bleuchamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.71,0:45:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 博堪普伯爵？- 是法语“布费德”的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- De Bleuchamp? - French form of Blofeld.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.42,0:45:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得 你的疯人院行动终止了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been relieved from Operation Bedlam, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.39,0:45:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信你会重新要我执行行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assumed you'd reassign me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.72,0:45:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是信件的副本\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a Photostat copy of a letter…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.92,0:45:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,寄往伦敦的徽章研究学院\N{\fnArial\fs30}…addressed to College of Arms in London…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.23,0:45:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,目的是要求确认 博堪普伯爵的头衔\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with a request to establish de Bleuchamp's claim to the title.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.13,0:45:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,希拉里布雷爵士 他是学院里传说中的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Hilary Bray, the sable basilisk of the college…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.47,0:45:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他答应格布德会亲自去见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}…has replied to Gumbold, suggesting they meet in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.30,0:45:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决定以追溯 我家族的徽章为耳目\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've taken the liberty of working with the college on this…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.97,0:45:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,已与学院联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}…using an examination of my own family as cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.81,0:45:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也正在研究纹章学的 技术性范畴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've also been studying the technical side of heraldry.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.98,0:45:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 希拉里布雷爵士 邦德长官 - 对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir Hilary Bray. Commander Bond. - Ah, yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.98,0:45:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,若他答应出席 我就装做是学院的代表\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he consents to a meeting, I could act as a college representative.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.09,0:45:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.63,0:45:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 午安 - 午安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good afternoon. - Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.76,0:45:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 把你的大衣给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this. Let me take your coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.76,0:46:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是汤姆士邦德的徽章 佩克汉男爵 1734年逝世\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arms of Sir Thomas Bond, Baronet of Peckham, died 1734.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.83,0:46:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑银色山形臂章 三个金币\N{\fnArial\fs30}Argent on a chevron sable. Three bezants.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.84,0:46:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好的格言：“世界是取之不尽”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good motto, "The World is Not Enough."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.01,0:46:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 菲迪亚干得不错 - 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Phidian's doing a splendid job. - Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.28,0:46:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们追溯 到奥塞邦爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've traced your line to a Sir Otho le Bon…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.78,0:46:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在1387年 在塞内特伯爵之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who held the manor of Wickhamsbreux by a knight's fee…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.95,0:46:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,当骑士而维持威克布洛克的大官邸\N{\fnArial\fs30}…from the Earl of Thanet, 1387.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.25,0:46:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.69,0:46:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,格布德从布纳尔打电话来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gumbold's telephoned from Bern…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.79,0:46:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,说他的客人会来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to say that his client will see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.12,0:46:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是说我 - 对 是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You mean me. - Yes, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.53,0:46:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但邦德长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Commander Bond…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.30,0:46:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,若这是关乎国家的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm only able to countenance this deception…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.80,0:46:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才可以答应瞒骗这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}…on your assurance this matter is of national importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.63,0:46:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有夸大其辞 很高兴你愿意帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't exaggerated. We appreciate your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.64,0:46:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这段时间我安排了 去布列塔尼半岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. During the deception period, I've arranged to go to Brittany.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.98,0:46:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想去学拓印技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to do some brass rubbings.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.41,0:46:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该去哪里见他呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do I go for this meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.15,0:46:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要我描述自己的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want a description of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.35,0:46:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说成是我的样子好了 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tactfully adjusted to favor me. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.09,0:46:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会告诉我 接我的时间和地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will send the time and place where I am to be…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.99,0:46:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他们的说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}…collected, as they put it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.99,0:47:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我们平常做的事 但在这情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not our sort of thing, but under the circumstances…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.66,0:47:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听起来他们起了疑心 - 不是可疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sounds like they're suspicious. - No, not suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.50,0:47:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是考虑周到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just discreet.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.60,0:47:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不反对煤付一千块的费用\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was no objection to my fee of 1000 guineas.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.10,0:47:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们说的会不会是真的？- 暂时很难说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Could their claim be genuine? - It's hard to say at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.44,0:47:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,要到我们肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never like to speak until we're absolutely certain…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.31,0:47:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我方没有搞错\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that there's no error on our side…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.85,0:47:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是他们没有在伪造证据 才能下判断\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or forgery on theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.45,0:47:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望我达到你这么高的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope I meet your high standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.45,0:47:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个身体上的特征 可能对你有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}One helpful physical point might be…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.62,0:47:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的博堪普家族是没有耳垂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that the real de Bleuchamps are without earlobes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.82,0:47:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是可以尽信的东西 但可能有帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the sort of thing that we rely on, but it could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.42,0:47:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有耳垂 - 你得邀请他到奥格斯堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No earlobes. - You might invite him to Augsburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.19,0:47:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们祖先几代都在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been there for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.46,0:47:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我想带他离开瑞士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'd like to get him away from Switzerland.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.85,0:48:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 希拉里布雷爵士？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir Hilary Bray, baronet? - The same, dear lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.62,0:48:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是尔犸邦特小姐 伯爵的私人秘书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Fraulein lrma Bunt, personal secretary to the count.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.52,0:48:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 旅途愉快吗？- 挺难受的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you had a good journey? - No, quite intolerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.43,0:48:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很少旅游\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a good traveler.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.79,0:48:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 格伦瑟会替你拿行李\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Grunther will take your luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.26,0:48:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不用了 - 我替你拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I can manage. - I take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.53,0:48:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你来过瑞士没有？- 没有 小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know Switzerland, Sir Hilary? - I'm afraid not, Fraulein…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.77,0:48:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 邦特 - 邦特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bunt. - Bunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.97,0:48:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个有趣宗谱学家的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting name for a genealogist.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.84,0:48:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你来自海军世家？- 海军？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you from a naval family? - Naval?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.18,0:48:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是海上用的词汇 意思是鼓胀的帆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a nautical term, meaning the baggy or swollen parts of a sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.51,0:49:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请不要介意 - 有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing personal, of course. - Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.18,0:49:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会说德语吗？- 不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You speak German? - I'm afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.85,0:49:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 法语呢？- 还可以 我们去哪里呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- French? - A little. Where are we off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.15,0:49:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会觉得失望的地方 请\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will not be disappointed. Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.99,0:49:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像地毯上的小虫吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the bugs in a rug, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.66,0:49:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 舒服吗？- 很舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You are comfortable? - Yes, indeed, fraulein.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.83,0:49:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真的很客气 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your kindness is quite overwhelming. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.14,0:50:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走了一半路程\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we are halfway.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.05,0:50:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们坐飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we will have a little flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.38,0:50:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没坐过这种飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been in one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.15,0:50:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,请弄灭你的烟斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must your pipe knock off.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.22,0:50:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指的是“弄熄”吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}"knock out", you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.55,0:50:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.56,0:50:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,请小心别碰到头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind your head, Sir Hilary.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.89,0:50:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,请系紧安全带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please fasten your safety beIt.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.37,0:50:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了阿尔卑斯山\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, up into the Alps.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.48,0:51:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是雪崩造成的破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is avalanche damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.47,0:51:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢滑雪或者玩雪橇吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You enjoy the skiing or the bobsled perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.21,0:51:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不爱做运动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a sporting man, fraulein.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.48,0:51:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是我精神很好的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even when I'm at my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.45,0:51:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你晕机？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you feel the airsickness?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.17,0:52:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那里为止是公众地方 这里以上是私人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up to there is for the public, and from here upwards it is private.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.40,0:52:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有伯爵批准不能进入\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one may come through without permission from the count.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.01,0:52:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是博堪普研究中心 研究敏感治疗的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is the Bleuchamp Institute for Allergy Research.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.35,0:52:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪种敏感？- 各种敏感\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What kind of allergies? - All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.19,0:52:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如说干草敏感症 对蠔的敏感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the hay fever, or the sickness caused by the oysters…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.86,0:52:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是对吃肉的敏感\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or inability to eat meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.89,0:52:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯爵是这方面的专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}The count is a great specialist in this field.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.87,0:52:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,若可以踏足地上就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be glad to get my feet on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.11,0:52:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是地上 是冰上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not ground. Ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.24,0:53:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得告诉你 看见手枪我会很紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should warn you, guns make me very nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.05,0:53:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些手枪用来对付 其他公司的间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are to keep the spies from the chemical companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.18,0:53:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经多次盗取我们的发明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many times already they have tried to steal our discoveries.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.82,0:53:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的世界充满贪婪和欺诈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We live in a world of avarice and deceit.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.36,0:53:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 起码这里没有贪婪 - 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here at least is no avarice. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.36,0:53:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,博堪普研究中心是非营利的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bleuchamp lnstitute is not for profit, Sir Hilary.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.10,0:53:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯爵只为人类而工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}The count does his work for the sake of mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.07,0:53:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very happy to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.20,0:53:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想留芳百世\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to leave his mark on the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.21,0:53:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 典型的抱负 - 什么典型？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Characteristic ambition. - Characteristic?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.21,0:53:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,典型的人道主义者抱负\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of a true humanitarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.31,0:54:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里以前是运动俱乐部 给公众使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Formerly it was a sports club, open to the public.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.71,0:54:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这里为伯爵所有 作研究之用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it belongs to the count, who has given it to scientific research.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.65,0:54:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,约瑟 布雷爵士会住四号房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joseph, Sir Hilary Bray will take number four.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.39,0:54:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦瑟带你做身体检查以后 我会带你到房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show you there after Grunther takes you for medical examination.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.86,0:54:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我现在没事了 - 你是我们的贵宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm quite all right now. - You are our honored guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.16,0:54:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.36,0:54:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才坐直升机晕机\N{\fnArial\fs30}After your experience in the helicopter…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.30,0:54:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得确保你的状况正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we must make sure you are well again.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.84,0:54:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦瑟 带希拉里爵士见丰山医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grunther, take Sir Hilary to Dr. Von Sant.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.48,0:54:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.85,0:54:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,像平常一样招待他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him the usual comforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.16,0:54:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有十分钟时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have 10 minutes…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.39,0:54:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后带他去四号房\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and then take them to number four.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.73,0:54:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你有什么需要 按这个铃\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wish anything for your comfort, you must ring this…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.50,0:55:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,服务生就会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the attendant will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.74,0:55:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,很细心 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very considerate. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.74,0:55:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你想出去 你也得按这个铃叫他开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must also ring for him to open the door when you wish to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.75,0:55:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好复杂的安排 - 这可以防止病人在该休息时\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Complicated arrangement. - To stop patients leaving their rooms…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.58,0:55:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开自己的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when they should be resting.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.52,0:55:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯爵认为不被打扰的休息很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}The count believes very strongly in undisturbed rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.22,0:55:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么时候可以见他？我们要讨论很多事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prudent fellow. When can I see him? We have much to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.56,0:55:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他准备好就会来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will send for you when he's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.10,0:55:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在请你在晚饭前跟我到 阿尔卑斯山房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meanwhile, I'd like you to join me in the Alpine room before dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.54,0:55:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿尔卑斯山房间？- 对 格伦瑟会来接你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alpine room? - Yes. Grunther will come for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.41,0:55:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 七点钟好吗？- 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shall we say 7:00? - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.38,0:57:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦特小姐会接你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fraulein Bunt will receive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.42,0:58:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,希拉里爵士 请来跟我们的病人见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Hilary, please, come to meet our patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.72,0:58:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是希拉里布雷爵士 次男爵 - 你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is Sir Hilary Bray, baronet. - How do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.86,0:58:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是著名的宗谱学家 要喝点什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a famous genealogist. You will have a drink, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.19,0:58:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请坐 - 你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please, come and sit down. - How do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.36,0:58:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.50,0:58:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么是次男爵？- 属于次等的爵位\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is a baronet? - An inferior sort of baron.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.20,0:58:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真让人失望 - 其实\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, how disappointing. - Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.54,0:58:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说你次等 我是指那个头衔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I don't mean you're inferior. I mean the title is.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.21,0:58:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那宗谱学家是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a gyn… genealogist? What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.51,0:58:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是老人家的医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}An old people's doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.38,0:58:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他来医治邦特小姐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he's here to cure Fraulein Bunt?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.05,0:58:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 她的耳朵很灵的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful. She's got ears like an elephant.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.72,0:58:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请问要喝点什么？- 麦芽酿的威士忌加水\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What will you drink, sir? - MaIt whiskey and branch water.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.05,0:58:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我对你的头衔不敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I was so rude about what a baronet is.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.86,0:58:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave a very accurate description.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.36,0:58:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先生 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.26,0:58:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,偶尔有男士是个赏赐\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a treat, having a man here for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.57,0:58:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说这里没有男人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean there aren't any others?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.87,0:58:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有职员吧 他们不算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the staff, and you can't really count them.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.37,0:58:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别谈论诊所的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't discuss the affairs of the clinic.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.61,0:58:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 但宗谱学家是什么？没有人会告诉我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but what is a genealogist? Will nobody tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.71,0:59:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我乐意告诉你 - 真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I would be pleased to tell you. - Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.58,0:59:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗谱学是关于祖先和家庭的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Genealogy is all about ancestors and families.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.55,0:59:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都有可能跟皇室有连系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could easily be that any one of you here is related to a royal house…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.99,0:59:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们追溯得够远\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if only we could go back far enough to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.92,0:59:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你告诉我你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you will tell me your names…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.93,0:59:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里不用姓氏 这是诊所的规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not use surnames here. It is a rule of the clinic.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.36,0:59:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我并不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry. I didn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.90,0:59:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 晚饭时间到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, it's time for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.73,0:59:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的时间表很严紧 食疗法也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our schedule is rather strict. So is our diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.74,0:59:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你坐在海伦和鲁比中间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, if you will sit there between Helen and Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.24,0:59:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很少跟年轻女孩相处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never had much to do with young ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.61,0:59:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你预备了 皮兹格洛莉亚的牛排\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have ordered you a steak Piz Gloria.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.25,0:59:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 希望你喜欢 - 谢谢 一定会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I hope you enjoy it. - Thank you. I'm sure I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.49,0:59:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你来过耶诞节吗？- 可能会 假如\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you here for Christmas? - Well, I might be if…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.80,0:59:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们离开前可以开个派对 - 我不喜欢这玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can have a party before we go! - That's not quite in my line.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.00,0:59:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,味道很好！我以前不吃鸡肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delicious! I used to hate chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.67,1:00:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃鸡肉会让我过敏 你绝对不会想到在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It used to make me break out all over. You'd be surprised where.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.67,1:00:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对马铃薯也敏感 现在我爱死它们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Potatoes did it to me. Now I adore them.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.84,1:00:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别谈论你们的病历\N{\fnArial\fs30}No medical histories, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.98,1:00:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 相信希拉里爵士乐意 向我们介绍徽章研究学院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girls, I'm sure Sir Hilary would like to tell us about the College of Arms.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.99,1:00:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,请告诉我们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, Sir Hilary. Please tell us.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.02,1:00:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只要你们喜欢就行 - 请说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If you'd really enjoy that. - Please. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.16,1:00:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们一定会听 - 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We promise to listen. - Would you?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.90,1:00:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 告诉我们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, tell us all about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.77,1:00:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,纹章学院或者徽章研究学院\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Heralds' College, or College of Arms…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.37,1:00:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一共有十三位皇家的成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}…consists of 13 members of the royal household…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.14,1:00:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,获国家委任管理\N{\fnArial\fs30}…appointed by the sovereign to superintend…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.04,1:00:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括纹章集 宗谱图 礼仪和其他事务\N{\fnArial\fs30}…armourial, genealogical, ceremonial and other matters.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.34,1:00:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,十三位成员分为三个类别\N{\fnArial\fs30}The 13 members are divided into three categories…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.35,1:00:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇者 纹章部和追溯者\N{\fnArial\fs30}…kings, heralds and pursuivants.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.98,1:00:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的头衔和工作 都有悠久的历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their titles and offices are of great antiquity.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.39,1:00:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一位纹章院院长的职位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the first Clarenceux king of Arms…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.73,1:00:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,创设于1334年\N{\fnArial\fs30}…was created in 1334…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.90,1:01:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,1448年有第一个萨默塞特纹章\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the first Somerset Herald in 1448.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.57,1:01:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们要核准一个徽章的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, when we authorize a coat of arms…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.24,1:01:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当中有许多有趣的图案\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it can include all sorts of funny things…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.71,1:01:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如说半月形 升降闸门\N{\fnArial\fs30}…crescent moons, portcullises…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.07,1:01:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,各种形状的野兽 线条 钱币\N{\fnArial\fs30}…beasts couchant and rampant, bars, bezants…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.91,1:01:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问钱币是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, what is "bezant"?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.08,1:01:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一种金币\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gold balls.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.48,1:01:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带来了一本徽章的图册 有关我的徽章\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought a book on the subject with a picture of my coat of arms.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.82,1:01:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面就有四个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which includes four of them…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.09,1:01:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有兴趣看吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if you'd care to see them.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.26,1:01:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有兴趣 我住在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd love to. I'm in room…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.46,1:01:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 我会问他拿那本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. He will give the book to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.13,1:01:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,再让你们传阅吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will pass it to everyone in turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.44,1:01:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这比较公平 - 当然 按你的意思办吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It is fairer like that. - Of course. If you think so, fraulein.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.62,1:01:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么不对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anything the matter, Sir Hilary?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.79,1:02:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概肩膀觉得有点僵硬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a slight stiffness coming on in the shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.10,1:02:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为身在高处所致吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Due to the aItitude, no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.37,1:02:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯爵想见你 格伦瑟会带你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The count will see you. Grunther will take you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.94,1:02:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 不好意思 我离开一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Please excuse me, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.14,1:02:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你们的敏感都早日康复吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}May all your allergies be swiftly cured.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.52,1:02:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真是个好男人 - 很可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What a nice man. - Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.82,1:02:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他对什么敏感\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what he's allergic to.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.33,1:02:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱币\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bezants…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.39,1:03:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,消毒器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Antisepsis.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.95,1:03:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,请在这里等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please wait here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.04,1:03:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚安 希拉里爵士 - 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good evening, Sir Hilary. - Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.20,1:03:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是巴达哈博堪普伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}BaIthazar, Count de Bleuchamp.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.24,1:03:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是来调查你的爵位\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'll forgive me, that's what I'm here to find out.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.58,1:04:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是来确定所有事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}To confirm. There can be no doubt of the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.61,1:04:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请坐 - 若是没有怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please, sit down. - If there were no doubt…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.45,1:04:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不会被派到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm sure I would not have been sent.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.72,1:04:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你来了我会让你了解清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, since you are here, I'll make everything very plain to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.59,1:04:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我一出生就没有耳垂\N{\fnArial\fs30}To begin with, I was born without earlobes…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.46,1:04:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是众所周知的博堪普家族特征\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a well-known congenital distinction of Bleuchamp ancestry…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.40,1:04:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像哈布斯堡家族的嘴唇 或者美第奇的鹰鼻子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}…like the Hapsburg lip or the hawk nose of the Medicis.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.40,1:04:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 但即使你是博堪普家的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granted, but the fact that you're a de Bleuchamp…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.11,1:04:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不一定是伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}…doesn't make you the reigning count.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.24,1:04:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉得到我是贵族血统\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel it in my blood and in my bones.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.41,1:04:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想学院需要更多的证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid the college will require more concrete proofs.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.45,1:04:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也应该有这些证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it shall have them.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.42,1:04:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经预备了有关的文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have assembled all the relevant documents…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.78,1:04:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,头衔证书 生死证明书\N{\fnArial\fs30}…title deeds, certificates of birth and death.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.12,1:04:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会送到你的房间给你鉴证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll send them to your room for authentication.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.59,1:04:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有任何需要 告诉邦特小姐就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've only to ask Fraulein Bunt for anything you require.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.69,1:04:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在这里舒服吗？- 不错 但你的诊所让我迷惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you comfortable here? - Yes, but puzzled by your clinic.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.10,1:04:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多先驱者作为 都让凡人感到迷惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The methods of the great pioneers often puzzle conventional minds.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.67,1:05:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发明了治疗敏感的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've devised a cure for allergies…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.74,1:05:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,重点在于\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which depends on holding an unusual…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.64,1:05:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,取得心理的平衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and delicate psychological balance.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.44,1:05:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我给病人特别的治疗环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I must impose rather special conditions on my patients.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.65,1:05:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你的实验室？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your laboratories?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.32,1:05:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,治疗不只是心理方面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cure is not entirely psychological, Sir Hilary.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.45,1:05:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们准备了特别的疫苗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are special vaccines to be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.69,1:05:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会为个别病例改造疫苗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vaccines which must be modified to suit each individual case.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.36,1:05:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm a very busy man…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.36,1:05:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不一定可以给你太多时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I cannot spare you as much time as I might wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.63,1:05:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,要确定你是否博堪普家族的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be confirmed as Count de Bleuchamp…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.90,1:05:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得给我多一点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you must give me some of your time.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.97,1:05:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你在生的亲杯 父母和祖父母的详细资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need details of your living relatives, parents and grandparents.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.64,1:05:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看那些文件就够了 - 可解答问题 但不能找出真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The documents you will see… - Can answer questions, but not all.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.31,1:05:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.35,1:05:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你能跟我一起去奥格斯堡 会有帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would help if you could accompany me to visit Augsburg.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.32,1:05:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奥格斯堡？- 那是博堪普家族的故乡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Augsburg? - The de Bleuchamps' ancestral home.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.65,1:05:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里教堂有他们祖坟\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are tombs in the cathedral…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.89,1:05:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,市政府还有重要的记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and important records in the city archives.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.32,1:05:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你能亲自跟我一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You there to assist with your personal knowledge…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.83,1:05:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时还不方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}That may not be convenient for some time…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.20,1:05:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我的名衔一定会获得核实\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but my title shall be recognized.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.53,1:06:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以开始进行初步的调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may proceed with your preliminary research.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.43,1:06:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会马上开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be happy to start immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.04,1:06:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 格伦瑟先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Herr Grunther.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.35,1:08:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,希拉里爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Hilary!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.19,1:08:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你带了那本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought you the book.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.39,1:08:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是解图集吗？- 不要开灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The illustrated book? - No, don't turn it on.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.89,1:08:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想看看那些图画 - 你自己就是一幅画\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want to see the pictures. - You're a picture yourself…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.23,1:08:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在火光下更加明艳动人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and twice as lovely in the firelight.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.73,1:08:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有趣 你假装不喜欢女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are funny, pretending not to like girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.04,1:08:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我平常不喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't usually.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.71,1:08:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你与众不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not usual.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.24,1:08:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那口红让人遐思 你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That lipstick was an inspiration. So are you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.38,1:09:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,希拉里爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Sir Hilary.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.88,1:09:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我礡利吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me "Hilly."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.98,1:09:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,礡利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hilly.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.72,1:09:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.22,1:09:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁比巴特利特 从兰开夏来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby Bartlett, from Lancashire.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.49,1:09:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 应该说是莫克姆湾 - 你怎么到这里来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morecambe Bay, actually. - How did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.19,1:09:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得现在就谈吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have to talk about that now?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.75,1:09:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.89,1:09:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么到这里来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.16,1:09:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对鸡非常敏感\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had this awful allergy about chickens.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.13,1:09:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家有个鸡场\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family has a chicken farm…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.06,1:09:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次在那里工作时 我都难受得要命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and whenever I had to work on it I nearly died.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.80,1:09:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有位专家说有一所瑞士的诊所\N{\fnArial\fs30}A specialist said there was a Swiss clinic…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.40,1:10:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为在做研究 所以会免费给予医治\N{\fnArial\fs30}…where they cured you, free, because they're doing research.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.28,1:10:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续吧 不 我是说诊所的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on. No, about the clinic, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.75,1:10:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那专家安排我 在伦敦跟邦特小姐见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the specialist had me meet Fraulein Bunt in London…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.19,1:10:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说我的病情很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and she said I had a very interesting case.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.09,1:10:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}How right she was.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.06,1:10:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,礡利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Hilly!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.63,1:10:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别理它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, bother!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.63,1:10:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这是治疗的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Hilly. It's part of the cure.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.27,1:10:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,七号录音带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cassette number seven.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.02,1:10:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,八号录音带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number eight.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.45,1:10:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得你刚来的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember when you first came here…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.16,1:10:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你多讨厌鸡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…how you hated chickens?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.83,1:10:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一见到鸡就会很不舒服？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you were sick when you even saw one?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.40,1:11:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在一切都过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But all that is over now…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.50,1:11:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我让你知道 那是多无聊的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for I have shown you how foolish it was…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.60,1:11:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你也快痊愈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and your cure is nearly done.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.47,1:11:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我教你去喜欢鸡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have taught you to love chickens…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.04,1:11:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢鸡肉和他的叫声\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to love their flesh, their voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.84,1:11:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快痊愈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, your cure is nearly done.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.68,1:11:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快你就会回家去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And soon you will go home…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.12,1:11:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找你喜欢的鸡\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to look after the chickens that you love so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.22,1:11:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有一点喜欢我 是吗 礡利？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do love me just a little, don't you, Hilly?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.56,1:11:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走之前要学会一件事情 - 鲁比\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Learn one more thing before you go. - Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.16,1:11:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会教你怎么特别照顾他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must teach you how to give them special care.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.17,1:11:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会告诉你怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will tell you what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.87,1:11:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲁比 醒来吧 - 我会告诉你什么时候做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ruby, wake up. - I will tell you when.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.67,1:11:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,和怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will tell you how.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.97,1:11:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你办完我教你的事以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after you've done what I teach you…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.24,1:11:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会永远的忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you will forget it forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.08,1:11:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.87,1:12:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,礡利 你这魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hilly, you old devil.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.61,1:12:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是我 - 真想不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It is me, yes? - Quite undeniably, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.91,1:12:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么出来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get out?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.85,1:12:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,用指甲刀 轻而易举\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a fingernail file. It's so easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.12,1:12:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.73,1:12:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来看你的解图集 - 好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I come to see the book, the pictures? - Jolly good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.23,1:12:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我放在哪里呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, where did I put it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.23,1:12:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才好像还在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had it a few moments ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.74,1:12:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不如开灯吧？- 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Perhaps if we turn on the light? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.81,1:12:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己就是一幅画\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a picture yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.27,1:12:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在火光下更加明艳动人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And twice as lovely in the firelight.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.71,1:12:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是 爵士 - 礡利\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But, Sir Hilary… - Hilly.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.65,1:12:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你说你不喜欢女孩的 礡利\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think you do not like girls, Hilly.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.55,1:13:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我平时不喜欢的 但你与众不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Usually, I don't, but you're not usual.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.25,1:13:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这里惹人遐思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming here was an inspiration…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.72,1:13:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and so are you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.42,1:13:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,注定要这样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll need to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.89,1:13:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么？- 我们如此相遇像个奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What you say? - A miracle, our meeting like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.96,1:13:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我连你的名字也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know your name.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.27,1:13:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我晚点会告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you all about myself later.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.30,1:13:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,明早吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.51,1:14:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.45,1:14:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以带我到山顶上去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about a lift to the top?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.11,1:14:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是不行的 上面是私人地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not permitted. All is private.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.88,1:14:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但上面有餐馆 也有个运动俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}But surely there's a restaurant, a club up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.49,1:14:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看过广告\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen them advertised.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.16,1:14:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在都关门了 - 什么时候的事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's all closed now. - Since when?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.96,1:14:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我真的看过广告 - 你误会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've seen them advertised. - You are mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.33,1:14:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是几星期前的事 现在已经没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For many weeks, they are finished.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.20,1:14:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还是想到山顶去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'd still like to get to the top.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.23,1:14:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这里开始 上面都是禁区\N{\fnArial\fs30}From here up, it's forbidden!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.63,1:14:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是私人的地方 都关门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Private! Closed!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.00,1:14:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.93,1:14:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my turn now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.51,1:15:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 希拉里爵士 - 你早\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir Hilary! - Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.44,1:15:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早 你昨晚僵硬的肩膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning. Your stiffness of last night…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.38,1:15:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在没事了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it is all gone?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.85,1:15:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 起码暂时没事吧？- 跟我们一起玩冰上掷石游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For the time being. - Then come and do curling with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.05,1:15:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这消耗体力吗？- 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Won't that be frightfully energetic? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.39,1:15:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我示范给你看 - 也许你想教我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll show you. - Perhaps you'd teach me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.37,1:15:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开始吧 - 我们对你期望很高\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have a go. - We expect great things of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.08,1:15:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快要走了 我要见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're leaving very soon. I must see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.74,1:15:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚八点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight o'clock tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.56,1:16:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那男的一个人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the man was alone?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.07,1:16:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 各位早 - 你早\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning, ladies. - Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.84,1:16:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,希拉里爵士 你早 你的调查如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Sir Hilary. How's your research?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.91,1:16:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错 看来十分顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riveting, and very promising too.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.61,1:16:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没听过那么荒谬的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never heard anything so ridiculous in all my life!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.51,1:16:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬山也算犯法吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when is climbing a criminal offence?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.85,1:16:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 皮兹格洛莉亚是私人产业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Piz Gloria, sir, is private property.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.49,1:16:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个阿尔卑斯山也是吗？真荒谬\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole bloody Alp? Ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.36,1:16:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有警告牌 我的随从也警告过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are many signs, and my servant warned you down at the station.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.29,1:16:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,到你抛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your throw, I think it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.36,1:16:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚抛了 而且造成了混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had my throw. Made a mess of it, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.46,1:16:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不算 你可以再抛\N{\fnArial\fs30}That didn't count. You can throw again.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.80,1:16:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 继续 - 你很有礼貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, go on. - Very civil of you, fraulein.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.37,1:16:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些笨蛋无权向我开火 你究竟是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}… doesn't entitle these goons to shoot at me. Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.04,1:16:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是这个中心的总裁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the director of this institute.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.98,1:16:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会送你下山 以后别再骚扰我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be sent back down and will refrain from troubling us again!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.88,1:16:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我的东西呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about my belongings?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.25,1:16:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚点会送给你 - 但那是我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They will be sent later. - But they're mine!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.96,1:17:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的规则必须严格执行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have certain rules which must be observed.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.56,1:17:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会向政府投诉 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The authorities will hear about it! - Good day.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.37,1:17:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,总裁 我想应该叫你伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Director… Or count, as I think I can now safely say…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.04,1:17:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天下午我想休息 请你让我搭吊车下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I'd take the afternoon off, so if you send the car down…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.41,1:17:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但今早你已经休息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you've already had the morning off.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.78,1:17:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一点新鲜空气 这是辛苦的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have a bit of fresh air. Those ancestors are hard work.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.35,1:17:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以徽章研究学院的薪水优厚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the College of Arms is being very well paid.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.32,1:17:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 若你要这样 - 我真的要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If you put it like that… - I do put it like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.25,1:17:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你看看我的研究结果 然后马上到奥格斯堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show you what I've done, then we'll plan the trip to Augsburg…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.52,1:17:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尽快完成工作 - 在耶诞节？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …and finish it. - Over Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.09,1:17:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶诞节时资料库不会关门吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The archives will be closed, will they not?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.60,1:17:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 按摩时间到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, girls, it's time for our massage.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.83,1:17:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天的冰上掷石游戏时间完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girls, that is enough curling for today.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.31,1:17:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今晚我要见你 - 九点钟好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I must see you tonight. - Nine o'clock?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.01,1:17:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,十点钟？我要回去工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten? Well, back to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.45,1:18:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不到为何会大排长龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've no idea how it's piling up.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.41,1:18:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁比 是礡利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby! It's me, Hilly.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.48,1:18:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,礡利知道鲁比要走好难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hilly's so sad that Ruby's leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.55,1:18:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那老母牛有没有告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has that old cow told you?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.78,1:18:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸会 小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fancy meeting you here, fraulein!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.77,1:18:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶诞节快乐 007\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas, 007.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.38,1:18:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是希拉里布雷爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Sir Hilary Bray.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.31,1:19:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.38,1:19:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,纹章学院受尊敬的男次爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Respectable baronets from the College of Heralds…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.98,1:19:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会在诊所勾引女病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…do not seduce female patients in clinics.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.78,1:19:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且不会搞错资料细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the other hand, they do get their professional details right.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.39,1:19:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,博堪普家族的祖坟 不是在奥格斯堡的教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bleuchamp tombs are not in the Augsburg Cathedral, as you said…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.46,1:19:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是在圣安娜柯奇 希拉里布雷爵士应该知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but in the Saint Anna kirche. Sir Hilary Bray would've known.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.60,1:19:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A small slip.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.33,1:19:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,007要变成宗谱学家 得准备更详尽的道具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Takes more than a few props to turn 007 into a herald.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.60,1:19:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不要以为剪掉耳垂 就可以变成伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll take more than cutting off your earlobes to turn you into a count.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.27,1:19:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我还可以给你一点惊喜 但你再没什么惊喜给我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may yet surprise you, but I'm afraid you have no surprises left for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.41,1:19:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全知道你的行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know all about your mission, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.41,1:19:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的同事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your colleague…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.65,1:19:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个爱爬山的健谈者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a keen climber, such a brilliant conversationalist…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.52,1:19:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走以前已经告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}…before he left us.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.19,1:19:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然他会向上级报告我在哪里 - 我很怀疑这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course he reported where I am. - I doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.12,1:19:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管如何 没有人来救你的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In any case, no one's going to come to your rescue.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.69,1:19:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个小时内 联合国会收到耶诞佳音\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a few hours, the United Nations will receive my yuletide greetings:
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.67,1:19:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会知道 我拥有了一种科学技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}The information that I now possess the scientific means to control…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.24,1:20:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,足以破坏整个地球经济\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or to destroy the economy of the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.44,1:20:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时有更重要事要烦恼 你已不重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}People will have more important things to think about than you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.58,1:20:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们相信你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they believe your threat.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.61,1:20:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,会的 我随时预备好作出示范\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will. In any case, I have prepared a demonstration.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.68,1:20:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得去年夏天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that disagreeable outbreak…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.85,1:20:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在英国突然爆发的口蹄病吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of foot-and-mouth disease in England last summer?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.59,1:20:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以仔细向你们示范\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I shall instruct them, in very convincing terms…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.46,1:20:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么安排这种病诞生 自从那次以后我的能力也增强了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…exactly how I arranged that. And my capacity has improved since.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.57,1:20:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,防敏感疫苗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allergy vaccines?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.57,1:20:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是细菌 细菌武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bacteria. Bacteriological warfare.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.84,1:20:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不只这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a difference.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.41,1:20:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,自去年夏天起 我们最大的突破\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our great breakthrough since last summer…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.91,1:20:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是发明了一种病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}…has been the confection of a certain…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.28,1:20:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奥米加病毒 - 可以引致不育\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …Virus Omega. - Infertility.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.02,1:20:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,使动植物都会完全不育\N{\fnArial\fs30}Total infertility in plants and animals.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.52,1:20:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是只让几种动物生病 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just disease in a few herds, Mr. Bond…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.26,1:20:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是只会损失一些农作物\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or the loss of a single crop…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.12,1:20:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是完全灭绝一切 永远灭绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but the destruction of a whole strain, forever…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.19,1:20:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个大陆的生物都会消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}…throughout an entire continent.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.03,1:21:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,若还达不到我的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}If my demands are not met…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.80,1:21:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会继续有计划进行灭绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I shall proceed with the systematic extinction…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.53,1:21:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到全世界的动植物都消失为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of whole species of cereals and livestock all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.14,1:21:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括人类？\N{\fnArial\fs30}lncluding, I suppose, the human race?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.61,1:21:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想不会吧 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think, do you, Mr. Bond…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.04,1:21:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,联合国不会让这事发生吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the UN will let it come to that.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.38,1:21:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的科学家分析过 奥米加病毒样本以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not after their scientists analyze a small sample…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.31,1:21:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不会让这事发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of Virus Omega they have received.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.62,1:21:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,流行性不育病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Epidemics of sterility.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.82,1:21:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候万物没有生育 连种子也不会发芽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing is born. No seed even begins to sprout.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.26,1:21:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们定会找到解毒方法 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They'll find an antidote. - Of course!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.93,1:21:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要我给他们足够的时间才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I give them enough time.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.23,1:21:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会有时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll have time.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.10,1:21:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们收到警告 就会想办法解决它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once they're warned, you'll have a problem dispensing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.03,1:21:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已有对付方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}That problem has already been solved.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.80,1:21:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经训练了一批死亡天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been training my own special "Angels of Death."
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.84,1:21:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那些女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.17,1:21:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 还有许多像她们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those girls, and many others like them.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.54,1:21:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但究竟怎么行动？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But exactly how?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.35,1:21:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}That will remain my secret.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.55,1:21:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这次行动的酬金是多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many hundred millions do you want for your services this time?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.95,1:22:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次的条件是另类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time? This time, the price is of another kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.99,1:22:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也会觉得很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be amused when you know what.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.13,1:22:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时你还会留在这里当我的贵宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the meanwhile, I will keep you here as my guest.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.70,1:22:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以帮我说服当局\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be very useful in helping to convince the authorities…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.97,1:22:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,证明我所言非虚\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that I mean what I say…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.30,1:22:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,言出必行\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I'll do what I claim.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.94,1:22:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我带你去你的新住处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come. Let me show you to your new quarters.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.81,1:22:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信你得在这里多待一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're likely to be with us for some time, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.71,1:22:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}So first…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.35,1:22:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制一下你的不驯性格\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a little therapy to soothe your restless nature.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.12,1:22:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可怜 他也是不听话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor fellow. He was restless too.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.02,1:22:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这顽固的英国人 你真的太喜欢运动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You perverse British, how you love your exercise.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.63,1:22:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,每年几十个业余爬山者 都有同样的下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every year, dozens of amateur climbers end in the same predicament.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.20,1:22:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成的蜡像给游客一个警惕\N{\fnArial\fs30}A kind of waxworks show for morbid tourists.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.74,1:22:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear, dear me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.64,1:22:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 我们把你送回文明社会前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, now. Now, Mr. Bond, you must learn to be absolutely calm…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.48,1:23:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}…before we can accept you back into polite society.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.77,1:23:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Presents!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.17,1:23:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是饯行礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going-away presents…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.81,1:24:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯爵亲自送给你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…from the count himself, in appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.24,1:24:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想现在就打开它 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want to open mine now. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.48,1:24:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,等其他人一起来拆礼物会更好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is more fun to open them all together, yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.08,1:24:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐 我们等其他人来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please sit down. We will wait for the others.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.12,1:24:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 有礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, look, look!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.30,1:24:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶诞节前夕的蛋酒 我好像回到家里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eggnog on Christmas Eve. Just like home!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.73,1:24:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为我们而设的欢送派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a treat for the going-away party.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.24,1:25:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 祝你身体健康 - 干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your very good heaIth, my dears. - Cheers! Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.24,1:25:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以治愈你们真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has been so nice to cure you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.79,1:25:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个平安夜派对挺特别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has something special in it for the Holy Night celebration.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.44,1:26:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们将会踏上归途\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you're going on a journey. A journey home.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.64,1:26:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在你们得休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first you must rest for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.35,1:26:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rest. Rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.85,1:26:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rest…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.90,1:29:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会告诉你什么时候做和怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will tell you when, and I will tell you how…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.07,1:29:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是我们的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but it must be our secret.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.27,1:29:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你跟我的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours and mine. Our secret.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.78,1:29:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你办完我教你的事以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after you've done what I teach you…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.58,1:29:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会永远的忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you will forget it forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.12,1:29:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远 永远忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever. Forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.76,1:29:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你可以再睁开眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you may open your eyes again.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.76,1:29:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都有一份礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each of you has been given a present…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.13,1:29:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好可爱的小礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}…such a prettily wrapped present.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.60,1:29:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在可以打开它了 打开它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now is the time to open them. Open them.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.41,1:30:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 它们多漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, they're beautiful…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.18,1:30:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好想知道里面是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and you're longing to know what's inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.95,1:30:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都可以用 除了喷雾器以外\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may use anything but the atomizer…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.05,1:30:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你绝对不能碰这个喷雾器\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which you must never touch, never…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.05,1:30:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非我告诉你什么时候在哪里用\N{\fnArial\fs30}…until I tell you how and where to use it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.19,1:30:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开粉盒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the compact.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.70,1:30:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,调节下面的控制器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adjust the bottom control.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.17,1:30:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,每晚十二点 你要单独一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every night at exactly 12:00, you must be alone…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.37,1:30:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,开着接收器\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so you can switch on that receiver…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.31,1:30:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,接听我的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and listen for my voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.61,1:30:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会告诉你要做什么 我会告诉你什么时候做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what to do, I will tell you when…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.98,1:30:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,和怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I will tell you how.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.85,1:30:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,听完我说话以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you've heard what I say…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.62,1:30:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖上镜子把接收器收起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…push the mirror back to conceal the receiver again.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.72,1:30:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就把它关上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push it back now and close the case.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.60,1:31:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在再休息吧 休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now rest again. Rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.10,1:31:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.97,1:31:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,几分钟后你就会醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a few minutes, you will wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.41,1:31:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会忘了我刚才说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will not remember what I just told you…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.74,1:31:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到你回到家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}…until you return home.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.48,1:32:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好漂亮的礼物 - 我不太舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What a lovely present. - I don't feel too good.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.76,1:32:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 我们赶时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, girls, we are in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.60,1:32:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶诞节快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.53,1:33:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我该把你包成一份礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should've been gift-wrapped.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.06,1:35:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,放照明弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flare.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.36,1:35:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他想到村里去 - 到断崖前拦截他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's making for the village. - Head him off at the precipice.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.13,1:36:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}ldiot!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.89,1:38:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位再见了 耶诞节快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, girls. Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.76,1:38:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,新年快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a happy New Year.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.40,1:38:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.63,1:39:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.99,1:40:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.80,1:42:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}James.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.28,1:42:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜心 你怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darling, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.88,1:42:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人追杀我 - 我可以帮你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's people after me. - Can I help?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.55,1:42:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有车吗？- 在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you got a car? - Outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.79,1:42:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.53,1:42:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay close to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.82,1:42:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not far now.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.99,1:43:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,到车门边趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Near-side door.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.18,1:43:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许他没看见我 - 我不肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe he didn't see me. - I wouldn't go "Banco!" on that.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.85,1:43:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,要放弃坏习惯了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Giving up bad habits?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.75,1:43:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们该去哪里？- 到最近的邮局跟伦敦联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are we heading? - Nearest post office to contact London.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.63,1:43:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认得卡德基克 他们干嘛要追你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, Feldkirch. Why are they looking for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.16,1:43:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suspect they're trying to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.57,1:43:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drive on!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.27,1:43:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人追来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sign of them yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.01,1:43:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有人道谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or of someone saying thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.88,1:43:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 崔西 你的眼睛好明亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Tracy. You've got sharp eyes and beautiful…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.65,1:44:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有漂亮的耳垂 你在皮兹格洛莉亚干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earlobes. What were you doing so near Piz Gloria?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.89,1:44:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了新的兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I have a new interest in life.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.09,1:44:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是冬季运动吗？真有益\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winter sports? Very wholesome.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.79,1:44:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个冬季运动员 爸爸告诉我在哪里找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one winter sportsman, and Papa told me where to find him.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.50,1:44:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,专心驾驶吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep my mind on your driving.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.37,1:44:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我们到了 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. There it is, James. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.13,1:44:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}James!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.59,1:45:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,向他们开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot at them!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.86,1:45:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.03,1:45:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里的人群可以分散他们的注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}That crowd might discourage them.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.46,1:46:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,碰巧是交通繁忙时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we've hit the rush hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.34,1:46:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得停住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must stop them!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.75,1:46:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么能出去呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we get out?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.06,1:46:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他撞走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock him out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.14,1:47:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望我的大车尾撑的住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope my big end will stand up to this.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.09,1:47:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么出去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}James! How do we get out?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.24,1:47:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直向前走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep straight!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.63,1:48:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们可以从那里出去 - 但愿如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can get out there. - If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.64,1:48:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,连奖品也没拿就走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't even stop for the prize.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.11,1:48:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们现在需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you that crowd would discourage them.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.30,1:48:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们现在需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all we need right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.92,1:49:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,开进那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.66,1:49:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续前进吧 我去开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep moving. I'll open the doors.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.95,1:49:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 伯爵夫人 这里环境太差了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about the accommodations, contessa.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.59,1:49:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该先打电话来订房\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should have rung ahead and booked.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.19,1:49:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜我没有接上伦敦那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only I'd got through to London.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.02,1:49:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 起码你还有机会 - 但什么时候呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- At least you'll get another chance. - But when?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.75,1:50:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,先休息一下 我们得尽快上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get some rest. We'll push on as soon as we can.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.42,1:50:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码这里满干爽的\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least it's dry.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.31,1:50:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在上面究竟发生了什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What really went on up there, James?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.42,1:50:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在进行特务工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her Majesty's Secret Service is still my job.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.22,1:50:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但暂时你什么也做不了 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there isn't anything you can do about it at the moment, is there?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.96,1:50:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.27,1:50:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你干嘛还在想呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why are you thinking about it now?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.50,1:51:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.98,1:51:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想我们俩的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking about us.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.82,1:51:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔西 特务不能有后顾之忧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tracy, an agent shouldn't be concerned with anything but himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.06,1:51:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白 我们和以前一样好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand. We'll just have to go on the way we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.46,1:51:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.63,1:51:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找别的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have to find something else to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.70,1:51:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure, James?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.34,1:51:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.81,1:51:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再找不到像你这样的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I'll never find another girl like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.02,1:51:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嫁给我吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.60,1:52:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是认真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mean it?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.73,1:52:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.38,1:52:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯邦德先生和太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. and Mrs. James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.32,1:52:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,住在团比威尔斯的洋槐路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of Acacia Avenue, Tunbridge Wells.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.39,1:52:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那贝尔格莱维广场呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about Belgrave Square?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.46,1:52:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者罗马的维亚文尼图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the Via Veneto, Rome.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.96,1:52:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴黎吧 方便到图克特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paris, convenient for Le Touquet.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.06,1:52:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩纳哥 方便到瑞尼尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monaco, handy for the Rainiers.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.53,1:52:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方要多少钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder how much they're asking for this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.71,1:52:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们结婚那天才适合做这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The proper time for this is our wedding night.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.11,1:52:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的新年计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's my New Year's resolution.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.45,1:52:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听你的 亲爱的 - 你睡这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whatever you say, darling. - And that is yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.42,1:53:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 崔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, Tracy.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.66,1:53:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.61,1:53:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,新年还没到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not New Year yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.27,1:54:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 詹姆斯 - 继续走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- James! - keep going!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.91,1:55:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 轻而易举 - 干得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Simple! - Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.41,1:55:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真大胆\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had lots of guts.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.25,1:55:42.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（雪崩地区）
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.59,1:55:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们三个继续追\N{\fnArial\fs30}You three keep going.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.70,1:56:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,往树林去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's head for the trees!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.30,1:57:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 詹姆斯 - 继续走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- James! - keep going!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:13.61,1:57:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔西 抓紧我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tracy, cling onto me!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.73,1:58:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个坟墓够深到 不能让007再动了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A grave deep enough, I think, to prevent even 007 from walking.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.90,1:58:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓那女孩来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:45.00,1:58:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是联合国来电 红色扰频器\N{\fnArial\fs30}United Nations, sir. Red scrambler.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.94,1:58:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是M\N{\fnArial\fs30}M here.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:54.71,1:58:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们已按指示准备就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we're standing by as instructed.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.32,1:59:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.52,1:59:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:05.86,1:59:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没宣布最终决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}No decision has been announced yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.96,1:59:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 这消息会完全被封锁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, it's a total news blackout.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.16,1:59:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的线民很清楚情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my informant was very plain.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:13.26,1:59:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有多清楚呢？- 他们要向布费德妥协\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How plain, sir? - They're going to buy Blofeld off.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.93,1:59:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.37,1:59:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 条件呢？- 特赦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And the price? - Amnesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.37,1:59:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗脱过去的所有罪名\N{\fnArial\fs30}A full pardon for all past crimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:26.88,1:59:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有确认他的头衔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Official recognition of his title…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.35,1:59:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他可以 以博堪普伯爵的名义退休\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when he retires into private life as Count de Bleuchamp.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.05,1:59:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看来很执着爵位\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seems to set great store by that.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.05,1:59:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺有趣 他很势利\N{\fnArial\fs30}A very curious thing, snobbery.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.99,1:59:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么时候决定是否成交？- 布费德希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When will they conclude the deal? - Blofeld wants to know…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:43.66,1:59:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,明晚十二点前知道最后的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the council's decision not later than midnight the day after tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:47.33,1:59:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有时间先到 皮兹格洛莉亚用武力摧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}That gives us time to get to Piz Gloria first. In force.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:50.17,1:59:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 007 我的指示很清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, 007. My instructions are clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.87,1:59:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,破坏研究中心 还有布费德和他的病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroy the institute and destroy Blofeld and his virus with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:56.27,1:59:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这因为太冒险而被否决了 还有那些女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been rejected as too risky. Those girls…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.14,2:00:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道她们有多少人 更别说在哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God knows how many, let alone where.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.85,2:00:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,若破坏了中心的通讯控制台\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we destroy the center of communication controlling the girls…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.08,2:00:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些女孩干不了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}…they can do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.59,2:00:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有我的命令 你有你的 算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have my orders, you have yours. Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:13.29,2:00:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个帮我逃走的女孩 我们怎能不管她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl who helped me escape, we just leave her?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.39,2:00:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,本部门不理会你的私人问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}This department is not concerned with your personal problems.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:20.53,2:00:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这部门欠她一个人情 她救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This department owes her a debt. She saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.53,2:00:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯人院行动已经完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Operation Bedlam is dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:28.04,2:00:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你明白吗？- 明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you understand? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.84,2:00:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:34.34,2:00:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是马克安跩哥 跩哥建筑公司的主席\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your call to Marc Draco, head of Draco Construction.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:37.75,2:00:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跩哥？- 我就是 你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, Draco? - Yes, who is it?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:39.45,2:00:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 詹姆斯邦德 - 天啊 是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- James Bond. - Thank God, James.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:41.62,2:00:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你参与一桩破坏性的行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to interest you in a demolition deal…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.75,2:00:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要配备航空用品\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that requires aerial activity to install equipment.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:53.33,2:00:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真的可以 在上面找到崔西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure we're going to find Teresa when we get up there?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:56.70,2:01:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我颇肯定的 如果不是 我们也有个原因要上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty certain. If not, there's a good reason for going anyway.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.94,2:01:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了 好像是十字军\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you've explained. Quite a crusade.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.98,2:01:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候庆祝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a time for celebration.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.88,2:01:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许 等他们答应才庆祝吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps, if they agree.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.12,2:01:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不能再做些什么 你知道 他们也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can do nothing else and you know it, and they know it.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:17.92,2:01:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要的我都可以给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall be able to offer you anything your heart could wish for.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.13,2:01:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,要牺牲多少性命呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paid for with how many lives?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:24.99,2:01:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔西 别那么嚣张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come now, Tracy, don't be so proud.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:29.73,2:01:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸的财产 也不是完全合法得来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your own father's profession is not entirely within the law.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:33.50,2:01:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的同业也有很奇特的方式 保持秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}His brotherhood also have exotic ways to keep it a closed shop.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.01,2:01:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴塞尔指呼叫不明飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basle approach calling unidentified aircraft.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.61,2:01:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你进入了受管制的领空\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're flying in controlled airspace.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.91,2:01:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有你的飞行计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no flight plan filed on you.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:48.95,2:01:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人不知我们是十字军战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think some people don't know we're crusaders.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:54.19,2:01:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你能讨好我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you're very, very nice to me…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:57.99,2:02:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让你成为我的伯爵夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I could make you my countess.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:00.93,2:02:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经是个伯爵夫人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm already a countess.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:03.70,2:02:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你让我不快 我一定会让你很难受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whereas if you displease me, I can promise you a very different estate.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.60,2:02:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me, sir. - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:09.84,2:02:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你听一听无线电的讯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is something on the radio you should hear.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.91,2:02:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 苏黎世航空中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me. - This is Zurich information…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.28,2:02:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫不明飞机 请回覆\N{\fnArial\fs30}…calling unidentified aircraft. Over.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:19.48,2:02:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏黎世航空中心呼叫不明飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Zurich information calling unidentified aircraft.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.02,2:02:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么样？- 他们有三架直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well? - That helicopter is one of three.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:25.05,2:02:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有一架回覆 - 然后呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- None have answered air control. - And?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.12,2:02:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,附近有可疑飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are suspect aircraft in the vicinity.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.43,2:02:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,机长的姓名及目的地 请回覆\N{\fnArial\fs30}… pilot's name and destination. Over.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.00,2:02:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏黎世 这是F G S飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zurich, this is Foxtrot, Gulf, Sierra, leading Red Cross helicopter flight…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.20,2:02:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,将红十字会医疗物资到意大利\N{\fnArial\fs30}…carrying Red Cross medical supplies to Italy.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:41.20,2:02:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么问题？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the trouble? Over.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.04,2:02:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有你的航班记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no record of your flight plan.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.81,2:02:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:50.08,2:02:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 我们没有你的航班记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}I repeat, we have no record of your flight plan or registration. Over.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.08,2:02:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你该更新你的记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then your registrations must be out-of-date. Over.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.82,2:03:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,F G S飞机 这是苏黎世航空中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Foxtrot, Gulf, Sierra, this is Zurich information.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.49,2:03:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得在苏黎世降落和报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must land at Zurich and report.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:02.76,2:03:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 在苏黎世降落和报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say again, land at Zurich and report.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:05.03,2:03:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 完毕 - 你想谋杀吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Over. - Do you wish to commit murder?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.40,2:03:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 这是救援飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, this is a mercy flight…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:10.67,2:03:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着血浆和急救用品\N{\fnArial\fs30}…carrying blood plasma and emergency equipment…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:14.17,2:03:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,给意大利洛维戈\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for the victims of the Italian flood disaster…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:17.74,2:03:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,水灾的灾民\N{\fnArial\fs30}…at Rovigo.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.78,2:03:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复\N{\fnArial\fs30}I repeat:
Dialogue: 0,2:03:21.11,2:03:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是救援飞机 明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mercy flight. You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:25.58,2:03:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- G号机 S号机？- 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gulf, Sierra? - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:27.35,2:03:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是苏黎世 你们可以继续前进了 通话完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zurich. Very well, you may proceed. Out.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:30.35,2:03:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到没？根本没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see? It is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:32.49,2:03:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来摆平了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems to have settled it.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:33.92,2:03:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我们其中一个了回程受阻\N{\fnArial\fs30}In case one or both of us is delayed on the way home…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.13,2:03:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好有个集合点\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it's better to have a rendezvous for later.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:39.53,2:03:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没功夫说这些 因为我们被跟踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before we start getting sentimental, I think we're being followed.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:43.23,2:03:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在考虑你的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been thinking about your proposition.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:48.27,2:03:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,多说一点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, tell me more.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:51.14,2:03:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是空军控制中心 我们没有你的航班资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is military air control. There is no record of your mission.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:54.78,2:03:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变航道到苏黎世降落\N{\fnArial\fs30}AIter course to Zurich and land.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.88,2:03:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经派遣战机拦截\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fighters have been dispatched to intercept you. Over.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.58,2:04:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好再仔细查阅你的记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest you check your records again, carefully. Over.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:05.09,2:04:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 到苏黎世降落\N{\fnArial\fs30}I repeat, return to Zurich and land. Over.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.82,2:04:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟日内瓦的红十字会联络吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check with Geneva. Check with the Red Cross in Geneva.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.80,2:04:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你撤回你的战机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meanwhile, call off your air force.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:15.26,2:04:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的乘客感到不适了 - F G S号飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It is making my passengers sick. - Foxtrot, Gulf, Sierra…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:18.93,2:04:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 机上有乘客吗？- 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …you are carrying passengers? - Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:23.47,2:04:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是国际知名的报界代表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Distinguished representatives of the world press.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:28.18,2:04:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们受够了你的无理对待 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've had enough of your nonsense. So have I.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:31.18,2:04:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,通话完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over and out.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:37.69,2:04:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有很多话要说 但以后我们还有很多时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot more to tell, but there will be plenty of time later.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:42.76,2:04:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我到阿尔卑斯山房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me to the Alpine room.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:45.19,2:04:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里不舒服吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you unhappy here?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:48.50,2:04:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想看日出\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to see the dawn.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:51.47,2:04:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真浪漫\N{\fnArial\fs30}So poetic a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:54.87,2:04:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,当帕里斯抱着海伦观赏日出\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were all the world's charms to mighty Paris…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:58.34,2:05:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底有多陶醉呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when he found that first dawn in the arms of his Helen?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:03.85,2:05:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候才等到回覆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When do you expect the signal accepting your terms?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:07.68,2:05:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚十二点以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any time before midnight tonight.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:11.79,2:05:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,晨曦 世上之光 你的曙光\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Thy dawn, O master of the world, thy dawn.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.59,2:05:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你 阳光照遍草原\N{\fnArial\fs30}For thee, the sunlight creeps across the lawn.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:18.59,2:05:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你 船儿沉入大海\N{\fnArial\fs30}For thee, the ships are drawn down to the waves.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:22.00,2:05:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你 世界充满奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}For thee, the markets throng with myriad slaves.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:26.40,2:05:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你 铁捶捶击在铁钻\N{\fnArial\fs30}For thee, the hammer on the anvil rings.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:30.11,2:05:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让\N{\fnArial\fs30}For thee…
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.04,2:05:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,享乐的诗人歌唱\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the poet of beguilement sings."
Dialogue: 0,2:05:41.75,2:05:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 直升机 - 防守各处\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Helicopters! An attack! - Get all positions covered!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.69,2:06:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,监视她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look to the girl!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.58,2:08:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 崔西 - 感谢主\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tracy! Darling! - Thank God, Teresa!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:28.22,2:08:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, wait!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:30.59,2:08:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见手枪我会很紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guns make me nervous!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:32.02,2:08:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你尽了你的本分 带她到安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done your share. Get her to safety.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:40.60,2:08:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:42.83,2:08:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:44.23,2:08:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上接驳引爆线 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the circuit set up now! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:26.14,2:09:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 两边都铺好了？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All points covered? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:26.77,2:10:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,预备好引爆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All set to blow?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:27.97,2:10:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,设定在五分十秒后爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fuse is set for exactly five minutes and 10 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:31.31,2:10:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里会永久尘封\N{\fnArial\fs30}The place will be sealed forever.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:33.14,2:10:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那英国人有时间逃生吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will that give the Englishman time to get out?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:36.21,2:10:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也知道时间的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows the schedule.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:49.56,2:10:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去哪里？- 詹姆斯在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you going? - Where's James?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:51.56,2:10:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他晚点会加入我们 - 不能丢下他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He'll join us soon. - But we can't leave him!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:54.20,2:10:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他不需要你的帮忙 - 没有他我不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He doesn't need help! - I won't go without him!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:56.57,2:10:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:59.94,2:11:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子不打不成器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spare the rod and spoil the child!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:12.98,2:11:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,五 四 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five, four, three…
Dialogue: 0,2:11:16.08,2:11:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,二 一 开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}…two, one. Now!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:03.58,2:15:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被树叉住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's branched off.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:30.21,2:15:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 去拿白兰地好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind that. Go and get the brandy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:33.84,2:15:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是五星级的汉尼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five-star Hennessy, of course.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:59.73,2:16:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Royal Highnesses…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:01.67,2:16:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位来宾\N{\fnArial\fs30}…my lords, ladies and gentlemen…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:05.74,2:16:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,请向新郎和新娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the toast is, the bride and bridegroom:
Dialogue: 0,2:16:09.74,2:16:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯邦德先生和太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. and Mrs. James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:22.06,2:16:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 恭喜你 崔西 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good luck, Teresa. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:39.71,2:16:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很荣幸能跟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, it's a pleasure…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:42.04,2:16:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我失去三个 最好的特务的人见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to meet the man who cost me three of my best operatives.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:45.65,2:16:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 1964年11月的金块行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, November '64, the bullion job.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:49.05,2:16:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你的收获也不错 告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You even got away with quite a chunk of the haul. Tell me…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:58.93,2:17:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你 007\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations, 007.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:00.60,2:17:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我承认有时候觉得你有点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must confess that I've sometimes thought you a little…
Dialogue: 0,2:17:03.50,2:17:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不负责任？- 是的 你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- lrresponsible? - That's exactly the word. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:07.30,2:17:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这次我没什么可以抱怨了 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This time, my boy, I can't complain. - Nor can I.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:12.87,2:17:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 崔西？- 怎么了 爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Teresa? - Yes, Papa?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:14.08,2:17:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 我们虽没有机会见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, James, I know that we haven't always exactly seen…
Dialogue: 0,2:17:17.45,2:17:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了 若有需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, don't forget, if there's anything you ever need…
Dialogue: 0,2:17:20.52,2:17:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 这次我有一个小装置 我也懂得用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. This time I've got the gadgets, and I know how to use them.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:26.32,2:17:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,记着 听丈夫的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, obey your husband in all things.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:29.39,2:17:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 答应吗？- 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You promise me? - But of course I will.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:32.19,2:17:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我听你的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I always obeyed you.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:37.07,2:17:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 詹姆斯 祝福你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. Well, James, I wish you luck.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:41.20,2:17:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是第一次也是最后一次 记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the first and last time. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:44.81,2:17:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她比宝石或黄金更珍贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}An old proverb: "Her price is far above rubies, or even your million pounds."
Dialogue: 0,2:17:50.41,2:17:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是邦德太太了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because you are Mrs. Bond…
Dialogue: 0,2:17:53.15,2:17:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别忘了我的生日 - 我有忘记过吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …don't forget my birthday. - Have I ever?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:55.38,2:17:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你们幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of you, maybe all of you.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:00.09,2:18:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, James.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:02.82,2:18:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好开心 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very happy. Be happy, my darling.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:06.69,2:18:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:09.36,2:18:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your way.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:11.90,2:18:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 小心开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Goodbye! - Drive carefully!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:26.08,2:18:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱班霓 没有我你怎么办呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Moneypenny, what would you do without me?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:29.18,2:18:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总在婚礼哭泣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always cry at weddings.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:31.12,2:18:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,007从不重视政府的财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}007 never had any respect for government property.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:39.16,2:18:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没给你结婚礼物呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I haven't given you a wedding present yet.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:41.90,2:18:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had an idea about that.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:43.63,2:18:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个女儿 三个儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three girls, three boys.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:46.20,2:18:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吗？- 算是一个好开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pleased? - Not bad for a start.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:50.64,2:18:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们有一辈子的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, darling, now we have all the time in the world.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:04.95,2:19:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着花再说一遍吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say it with flowers!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:06.55,2:19:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就好像花店的广告车\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got a point. We do look like an ad for a flower shop.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:09.82,2:19:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想起了 我从没送花给你过\N{\fnArial\fs30}That reminds me, I didn't even send you flowers.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:16.36,2:19:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正你已经送我结婚礼物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, you have given me a wedding present.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:20.20,2:19:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是最好的礼物 美好的将来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best I could have: A future.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:24.54,2:19:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德太太 住…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Bond, shut…
Dialogue: 0,2:19:27.48,2:19:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,…口 别一次吃光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…up. And don't eat it all at once.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:31.85,2:19:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他爱我 - 无法解释的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He loves me… - Instinctively.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:34.58,2:19:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 无道理的 - 无尽的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Infuriatingly. - Intensely.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:37.55,2:19:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,无\N{\fnArial\fs30}In…
Dialogue: 0,2:19:39.05,2:19:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 无 - 无\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In… - In…
Dialogue: 0,2:19:42.02,2:19:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,无可置疑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indubitably.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:45.49,2:19:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生一个男的 再来一个女的\N{\fnArial\fs30}First a boy, and then a girl.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:56.87,2:19:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是布费德\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Blofeld!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:59.94,2:20:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是布费德\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Blofeld.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:29.44,2:20:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:32.01,2:20:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 她不过在休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's quite all right, really. She's having a rest.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:37.58,2:20:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很快就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be going on soon.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:46.09,2:20:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,别焦急 我们有一辈子的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no hurry, you see. We have all the time in the world.
